  - PASS iff all 14 hold: |ΔT60| ≤ 0.001 (T60 error, %), |ΔC50| ≤ 0.0005 dB, |ΔEDT| ≤ 0.005 ms, |ΔFD| ≤ 0.0005, |ΔR@k| ≤ 0.2 percentage points.
